{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"“They reanimated the hags! Those linked to the Hunger! And they had the gall to ask me to be around when they brought back something that stole a week of my life!” There are tears in their eyes. “Web was selfish! They’re not above reproach! And they had **no right** to chase us out when we finished cleaning up their mess.”","created_at":"2020-08-10T00:54:33.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742184078031323166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"\"Wynne.\" His voice is softer now. \"Take it down a level. Breathe. It is going to be alright, I will figure this out. Don't say that Web doesn't care. I believe they can be forgiven, and learn from this. Have a talk together. Don't let this anger boil to hate.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T00:57:08.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742184729197150238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
